{"id":"aKCwCJlY","slug":"structory","title":"Structory","description":"A seasonally updated and atmospheric structure mod with light lore","author":"Starmute","categories":["adventure","datapack","decoration","fabric","forge","neoforge","quilt","worldgen"],"display_categories":["adventure","datapack","decoration","fabric","forge","neoforge","quilt","worldgen"],"client_side":"optional","server_side":"required","project_type":"mod","downloads":9267734,"followers":1923,"license":{"id":"LicenseRef-Stardust-Labs-License","name":""},"loaders":["datapack","fabric","forge","neoforge","quilt"],"game_versions":["1.19","1.19.1","1.19.2","1.19.3","1.19.4","1.20","1.20.1","1.20.2","1.20.3","1.20.4","1.20.5","1.20.6","1.21","1.21.1","1.21.2","1.21.3","1.21.4","1.21.5","1.21.6","1.21.7","1.21.8","1.21.9","1.21.10","1.21.11","26.1","26.1.1","26.1.2","26.2","26.3"],"latest_version":"EV74q3tR","date_created":"2024-09-16T10:23:16.099678Z","date_modified":"2026-09-24T23:48:49.551399Z","updated":"2026-09-24T23:48:49.551399Z","color":4534550,"body":"# Structory\n\n[Latest Version](https://github.com/Stardust-Labs-MC/Structory/releases) [Stardust Discord Badge](https://discord.gg/stardustlabs) [Modrinth Badge](https://modrinth.com/mod/structory) [License Badge](https://github.com/Stardust-Labs-MC/license) [Wiki Badge](https://stardustlabs.miraheze.org/wiki/Structory) [Issues Badge](https://github.com/Stardust-Labs-MC/Structory/issues) [Weblate Badge](https://weblate.catter.dev/projects/stardust-labs)\n\nStructory is a seasonally updated, atmospheric structure datapack with light lore, including ruins, towers, cottages, graveyards, settlements, boats, and more.\n\n![structory_banner_squashed](/launcher-preview/bodies/aKCwCJlY/0.webp)\n\n## Notes\n- Structory is compatible with the majority of worldgen and structure datapacks, such as Terralith or Structory: Towers\n- You can add Structory to existing worlds, but structures will only generate in new chunks\n- View the structures per seed using [jacobsjo](https://github.com/jacobsjo)'s [Minecraft Datapack Map](https://map.jacobsjo.eu/)\n\n## Description\n### Seasons\nAlongside regular updates, Structory consistently receives themed content expansions. These feature short, ambient stories told through villagers and their structures, building on and adding to the structures already found throughout the world. \n\nSeason 1 brought the Ruins update. Deep inside the swamps, the **Mangrove Ruins** can be found... but if you dare venture into a colder climate, you may stumble upon the **Taiga Ruins**. What stories are these old structures trying to tell? Season 2 brought the Harvest update. Legend says evil witches can be found in the **Old Manor**, brewing something mysterious. but if you wander too far, you could find yourself trapped in a rare **Graveyard**.\n\n### Add-Ons\nSeparate from its content expansions, Structory will have add-ons which can be used either in conjunction with Structory, or as its own standalone datapack. This allows players and modpack creators to dynamically add or remove parts of Structory to fit their own taste and playstyle. For example, see [Structory: Towers](https://github.com/Stardust-Labs-MC/Structory-Towers)!\n__ __\n\n[![Patron Ad](/launcher-preview/bodies/aKCwCJlY/1.webp)](https://www.patreon.com/BotanyDev)\n\n[![Bisect Hosting Ad](/launcher-preview/bodies/aKCwCJlY/2.webp)](https://www.bisecthosting.com/Botany)\n","published":"2024-09-16T10:23:16.099678Z","additional_categories":[],"issues_url":"https://github.com/Stardust-Labs-MC/Structory/issues","source_url":"https://github.com/Stardust-Labs-MC/Structory","wiki_url":"https://stardustlabs.miraheze.org/wiki/Structory","discord_url":"https://discord.gg/stardustlabs","donation_urls":[{"platform":"Ko-fi","url":"https://ko-fi.com/stardustlabs"},{"platform":"Patreon","url":"https://www.patreon.com/BotanyDev"}],"team":[{"username":"catter1","role":"Maintainer","avatar":"/launcher-preview/avatars/catter1.webp"}],"versions_tota